WEBVTT

00:14:29.490 --> 00:14:31.281
AG: Now when I jump on the line late,

00:14:31.305 --> 00:14:33.377
people aren't disappointed or frustrated.

00:14:33.401 --> 00:14:34.552
They're often amused.

00:14:34.576 --> 00:14:37.907
AC: (Sings) Guess I'm on hold /

00:14:38.724 --> 00:14:40.806
I hope it's not all day.

00:14:40.830 --> 00:14:43.892
AG: So when I scheduled a call
with the guy who wrote this song,

00:14:43.916 --> 00:14:46.156
for once, I was deliberately late.

00:14:46.180 --> 00:14:49.071
I let him call in first,
so he could hear his own hold music.

00:14:49.095 --> 00:14:52.166
AC: Here's my voice. (Chuckles)

00:14:52.190 --> 00:14:54.753
Y'all sing along. (Laughs)

00:14:56.100 --> 00:14:58.536
AG: Alex Cornell wrote this song
for UberConference,

00:14:58.560 --> 00:15:00.646
because he hates hold music.